---
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Privacy Policy"
    description="Last updated: 2024-10-15"
    locale="en"
>
    <div class="legal-container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p>
            This site highly respects user privacy and personal information
            protection. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store,
            share, and transfer your information when you visit www.qladgk.com.
        </p>

        <h2>Information Collection During Visits</h2>

        <p>
            <strong
                >When you visit, services may collect the following information:</strong
            >
        </p>

        <p><strong>Network identifiers</strong> (browser UA, IP address)</p>
        <p><strong>Device information</strong></p>
        <p>
            <strong>Browsing behavior</strong> (interaction methods, browsing patterns
            and duration, performance and network loading)
        </p>

        <p>
            <strong
                >Third-party services on this site may collect additional
                information through the following methods:</strong
            >
        </p>

        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Tencent Cloud</strong> collects your visit information for
                providing website basic services and acceleration.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Alibaba Cloud</strong> collects your visit information for
                providing website basic services and acceleration.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Malicious access identification for website maintenance</li>
            <li>Malicious attack investigation for website maintenance</li>
            <li>Website click monitoring for layout optimization</li>
            <li>Website loading performance monitoring</li>
            <li>
                Website traffic sources and paths for search result optimization
            </li>
            <li>Website request statistics for popularity display</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies and Local Storage</h2>

        <p>
            This site uses local storage in your browser for features like
            comment system, console, dark mode toggle, and visitor statistics.
            You can clear all cookies and local storage at any time without
            affecting normal use.
        </p>

        <p>
            For information about how we use cookies, please visit <a
                href="/en/cookies">Cookies Policy</a
            >.
        </p>

        <h2>Information Sharing</h2>

        <p>
            I will not share your private information with any company,
            organization, or individual.
        </p>
        <p>
            I will not transfer your personal information to any company,
            organization, or individual.
        </p>
        <p>
            For third-party service sharing and transfer information, please
            refer to their privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>

        <p>
            If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact:
            qlad_adgk@163.com
        </p>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .legal-container {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-container h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--color-title);
    }

    .legal-container h2 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--color-title);
    }

    .legal-container p {
        color: var(--color-body);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .legal-container a {
        color: var(--color-link);
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .legal-container a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .legal-container ul {
        color: var(--color-body);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-container li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .legal-container table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .legal-container th,
    .legal-container td {
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        padding: 0.75rem;
        text-align: left;
    }

    .legal-container th {
        background: var(--color-surface);
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .legal-container td {
        background: var(--color-bg);
    }

    .legal-container strong {
        color: var(--color-title);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
</style>
